          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kunangwa ndaagwa mamumama imbiri wa Yahova amadiku arubaini mbasu nu vudiku kigira ndamanya ndi Yahova yaali nasaaviyi ligali kumudiviza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ndasaara ku Yahova, ‘O, Yahova Nyasaye Wuvunyali, utadiviza avandu voovo mba, avandu vawahonyia kandi nuvaleeta kutura Egebeti ku vonene vuvwo kandi ku zinguru zizio zinene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wizulizi avatumikiri vovo, Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. Utahenza uvuchamu vwa avandu yava anoho uvudamanu vwavo, anoho uvwoni vwavo mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gase, vandu va Egebeti valavoora ndi watamwa kuhila avandu vovo vaduuki mu kivala cha waali ni wavasuuviriza. Valavoora ndi wahila avandu vovo muchangalangwe kuvitira mu, kigira wavadunyira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kali ndio yava vaveeye avandu vovo, va ivi watovola vave avoovo kandi avawatuliza Egebeti kuzinguru zizio zinene kandi ku vunyali vuvwo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
